{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "_doc": "对话台词表（NPC / 台词 / 对话框 解耦，图模型）。\n规则：\n  1. 每个条目必须含 id + lines；lines 为图模型数组，每行字段：\n     - id: 本句唯一 ID（同条目内唯一）\n     - speaker_id: 说话人 ID（\"player\"=主角；其余填 NPC id，用于取名字/立绘）；可空\n     - speaker_name: 显示名（speaker_id 为空或解析不到时用作兜底）\n     - text: 台词\n     - next_id: 下一句 id；空字符串=本句后对话结束（若有 options 则优先选项）\n     - options: [{text, jump_id, cond?}] 分支选项；cond 不满足则隐藏\n     - cond: {kind, arg} 本句门槛（不满足则跳过本句跳 next_id）；空/null=恒真\n     - trigger_events: [event_key] 进入本句时触发的剧情事件（配置化）\n  2. NPC 配置通过 dialog_id 绑定本表任意 id；未配置则以 npc_id 回退。\n  3. 改台词/分支/选项只动本文件；改外观改 DialogOverlay.gd；改事件含义改订阅 EventBus.dialogue_event_triggered 的系统。\n条件 cond.kind 取值：quest_active(任务进行中) | has_item(持有道具) | favor(好感>=arg)，均对接 GameManager 各服务。",
  "dialogs": [
    {
      "id": "dlg_tutorial",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "tut_1", "speaker_name": "神秘老者", "text": "少侠初入江湖，可知刀光剑影皆由气血内力驱使？", "next_id": "tut_2", "trigger_events": ["sfx_elder_appear"] },
        { "id": "tut_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "愿闻其详。", "next_id": "tut_3" },
        { "id": "tut_3", "speaker_name": "神秘老者", "text": "胜负在天，亦在招式与心境。去吧，城外山贼正待你历练。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_wolf",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "wolf_1", "speaker_id": "npc_hunter", "text": "这阵子荒野里的恶狼越发猖狂，已伤了村里两头羊。", "next_id": "wolf_2" },
        { "id": "wolf_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "带我去看看。", "next_id": "wolf_3" },
        { "id": "wolf_3", "speaker_id": "npc_hunter", "text": "少侠小心，那狼群狡猾得很。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_sect",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "sect_1", "speaker_id": "npc_sect_elder", "text": "我观少侠骨格清奇，可愿入我青云剑宗？", "next_id": "sect_2" },
        { "id": "sect_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "入宗需得立下功劳？", "next_id": "sect_3" },
        { "id": "sect_3", "speaker_id": "npc_sect_elder", "text": "先过试炼一关，斩了那山贼头目，便算你入门之礼。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_village_chief",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "vc_1", "speaker_id": "npc_village_chief", "text": "壮士来得正好！城外山贼猖獗，扰得百姓不得安宁。", "next_id": "vc_2" },
        {
          "id": "vc_2",
          "speaker_id": "npc_village_chief",
          "text": "替老朽除去这股山贼，必有重谢。少侠可愿前往？",
          "next_id": "",
          "options": [
            { "text": "义不容辞，这就去", "jump_id": "vc_yes" },
            { "text": "（好感满）与村长把酒言欢", "jump_id": "vc_toast", "cond": { "kind": "favor", "arg": 50 } },
            { "text": "容我想想", "jump_id": "vc_no" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "vc_yes", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "区区毛贼，何足道哉。", "next_id": "vc_3" },
        { "id": "vc_3", "speaker_id": "npc_village_chief", "text": "善！城西已布下天罗地网，去吧。", "next_id": "", "trigger_events": ["sfx_quest_accept"] },
        { "id": "vc_toast", "speaker_id": "npc_village_chief", "text": "哈哈，少侠爽快！老朽敬你一杯。", "next_id": "" },
        { "id": "vc_no", "speaker_id": "npc_village_chief", "text": "也罢，少侠随时可来寻老朽。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "demo_npc",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "dg_1", "speaker_id": "demo_npc", "text": "少侠，老朽的玉佩被野狗叼走了，可愿帮老朽寻回？", "next_id": "dg_2", "trigger_events": ["sfx_beggar"] },
        { "id": "dg_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "区区野狗，何足道哉。", "next_id": "dg_3" },
        { "id": "dg_3", "speaker_id": "demo_npc", "text": "善！城西荒地那条野狗最为凶悍，替老朽除了它。", "next_id": "dg_4" },
        { "id": "dg_4", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "包在在下身上。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_bandit",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "bd_1", "speaker_id": "npc_bandit", "text": "此路是我开！要想过此路，留下买路财！", "next_id": "", "trigger_events": ["sfx_bandit_threat"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_hunter",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "hn_1", "speaker_id": "npc_hunter", "text": "少侠！荒野里的恶狼又出来伤人了，可愿帮俺除了它们？", "next_id": "hn_2" },
        { "id": "hn_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "带路。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_sect_elder",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "se_1", "speaker_id": "npc_sect_elder", "text": "少侠骨骼清奇，可愿入我青云剑宗？先斩山贼头目为入门之礼。", "next_id": "se_2" },
        { "id": "se_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "正合我意。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_merchant",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "mc_1", "speaker_id": "npc_merchant", "text": "上好的丹药兵刃，少侠可要瞧瞧？城东铁匠铺也有好货。", "next_id": "mc_2" },
        { "id": "mc_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "容后再看。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tactical_demo_master",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "td_1", "speaker_id": "tactical_demo_master", "text": "少侠可愿与老夫演一场战术战棋？此乃生死相搏之阵。", "next_id": "td_2", "trigger_events": ["sfx_tactical"] },
        { "id": "td_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "正要领教。", "next_id": "td_3" },
        { "id": "td_3", "speaker_id": "tactical_demo_master", "text": "善！布阵——", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_event_demo",
      "_doc": "事件系统技术演示：一条龙触发 音效(sfx) / 震屏(shake) / 接任务(quest_accept)。与 event_demo_npc 绑定。",
      "lines": [
        { "id": "ed_1", "speaker_id": "event_demo_npc", "text": "少侠，老夫乃「事件演示仙」。且看此间天地，如何因一言而震颤。", "next_id": "ed_2", "trigger_events": ["sfx_elder_appear"] },
        { "id": "ed_2", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "前辈请演示。", "next_id": "ed_3" },
        { "id": "ed_3", "speaker_id": "event_demo_npc", "text": "（震屏）——这便是 trigger_events 的「震屏」之力，画面当真晃了一晃。", "next_id": "ed_4", "trigger_events": ["bandit_threat_shake"] },
        { "id": "ed_4", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "地面确在颤动！", "next_id": "ed_5" },
        { "id": "ed_5", "speaker_id": "event_demo_npc", "text": "（接任务）——再赠你一桩「demo_quest」试炼，且去任务栏中观之。", "next_id": "ed_6", "trigger_events": ["accept_demo_quest"] },
        { "id": "ed_6", "speaker_name": "李十五", "speaker_id": "player", "text": "受教了。", "next_id": "" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
